 Mukesh Singh.<br /> <br /> Another dude from 18 Days in artifact armor and of course no helmet:<br /> <img src=\"http://th07.deviantart.net/fs71/PRE/f/2012/188/f/3/mbx_vol_03_12_bheem_juggernaut_normal_by_nisachar-d56bbj0.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Some awesome landscapes and ruins, perhaps near the Wyld:<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://bakenius.deviantart.com/art/Living-Trees-8172965\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/6b397023-d9fd-4ec2-a70d-26c5c894d41c/d4v6at-f2b5ef80-19c2-4aee-9368-11cb055b2f41.jpg/v1/fill/w_600,h_750,q_75,strp/living_trees_by_bakenius_d4v6at-fullview.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..TSnCQ2TKHAI39RD_5ow2pxZ8PVRy24M3qBZHKYRmKE0\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://bakenius.deviantart.com/art/Living-Trees-8172965\" target=\"_blank\"> Living Trees by Bakenius on DeviantArt </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://bakenius.deviantart.com/art/Living-Trees-8172965\" target=\"_blank\"> http://bakenius.deviantart.com/art/Living-Trees-8172965 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Living Trees &mdash; artwork by Bakenius on DeviantArt. Published: 2004-06-17 &middot; Likes: 1553 &middot; Views: 36871 &middot; Comments: 229 </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"http://hdscreen.me/wallpaper/2547681-fantasy-art-forests-surreal\" target=\"_blank\">http://hdscreen.me/wallpaper/2547681...orests-surreal</a><br /> <a href=\"http://hazzard65.deviantart.com/art/Swamp-concept-437105027\" target=\"_blank\">http://hazzard65.deviantart.com/art/...cept-437105027</a><br /> <a href=\"http://www.designyourway.net/diverse/diglan/Into-The-Overgrown.jpg?209eb7\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.designyourway.net/diverse...own.jpg