 eary First Age before more mechanical artifact conveyances were invented. Or maybe bred jn the Shogunate era. Either by the Dragon Blooded, tk replace artifact vehicles they could no longer maintain, or Lunars who didnt have acess to the required tools to build and majntain fleets of mechanical or magical transport.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-02T08:25:52-07:00","id":500403,"title":"","content":"It's just, when I think of oversized or overstylized beasts of burden, I think of something like Warhammer Fantasy, and it's an aesthetic I don't really see as fitting in Creation but not only fully congruous with the Fair Folk in its own right, but a basis for there to be a visual dissonance between them if they should fight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T07:40:00-07:00","id":501698,"title":"","content":"One of those amusement parks that were so popular in the First Age: