ance of the individual within it&quot; is something I find to be an apt description of the relationship between the Exalted and the world.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd rather not derail this thread, so we can take this elsewhere if you'd like, but...in what version of the Exalted setting are the Exalted &quot;insignificant&quot; to their world?<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And if that's the meaning ascribed to the painting, either by critics or even by the creator, then let's just say, I disagree!<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T09:31:20-07:00","id":554429,"title":"","content":"Some more arty-style inspiration:<br /> <img src=\"http://wac.450f.edgecastcdn.net/80450F/comicsalliance.com/files/2015/02/tumblr_nabtrsgnjZ1rv0p43o1_1280.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://t08.deviantart.net/zo9NRHiMkOBG8JDiw5ZteN1vxTU=/300x200/filters:fixed_height(100,100):origin()/pre14/e489/th/pre/f/2012/067/4/d/big_bad_wolf_by_ner_tamin-d4s4dn8.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <img src=\"http://36.media.tumblr.com/wG3q6cfGyazarpnjs8aMtJ0K_500.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-at