bat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T11:41:16-07:00","id":1152571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1152468#post1152468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">LBR Princess Mononoke is totes a lunar.<br /> <br /> And I guess her totem would be a wolf.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> and a wolf goddess mentor","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T12:15:23-07:00","id":1152582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1152478#post1152478\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nevertheless, I feel like I shall redeem myself, so... I'll take requests? I have at least a thousand images lying around, and I'm pretty sure only a fraction of it is a duplicate of stuff already seen in the thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>Allow me to shamelessly abuse your kindness... if you have anything that shows boats/ships and their crew/captain?<br /> I really want my Eclipse to have a cool image, but so far I haven't had the best of luck.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T13:42:28-07:00","id":1152601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wern212</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1152582#post1152582\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Allow me to shamelessly abuse your kindness... if you have anything that shows boats/ships and their crew/captain?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly, most naval-themed fantasy illustrations tend toward an Age of Sail aesthetics, so I don't have <i>many</i> of them, but I do have some!<br /> <br /> <br /> When I saw him, my mind immediately went &quot;yeah, <i>this guy's</i> an Eclipse&quot;. I mean, the sails in the background are pretty tattered, and the crew is being relegated to blurry figures in the background, but he undeniably looks cool, and whether he's holding a map or a ledger, it certainly accentuates the caste's role as explorers and bureaucrats way more than yet another anime dude with a fancy sword would.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.moregames.net.cn/uploadfiles/2015/10/201510191629332933.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> This one is pretty much the exact opposite of the previous: just pure, unadulterated ship porn:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://cdnb.artstation.com/p/assets/images/images/005/241/673/large/concept-4-concept4-highseas1.jpg?1489577039\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> And this is pretty much all I have on the subject. (I also had another really cool image in my &quot;Landscapes &amp; Scenery -&gt; West&quot; folder, but upon taking a closer look, I realized that the dark bluish-grey thing I mentally categorized as 'probably the sea' actually looks more like stone, and the upward-curving dark shape in the foreground next to our hero is, in fact, not an elaborate figurehead of some sort, but the roof of a building. Awkward.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T23:26:44-07:00","id":1152724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1152601#post1152601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sadly, most naval-themed fantasy illustrations tend toward an Age of Sail aesthetics, so I don't have <i>many</i> of them, but I do have some!<br /> <br /> When I saw him, my mind immediately went &quot;yeah, <i>this guy's</i> an Eclipse&quot;. I mean, the sails in the background are pretty tattered, and the crew is being relegated to blurry figures in the background, but he undeniably looks cool, and whether he's holding a map or a ledger, it certainly accentuates the caste's role as explorers and bureaucrats way more than yet another anime dude with a fancy sword would.<br /> <br /> This one is pretty much the exact opposite of the previous: just pure, unadulterated ship porn:<br /> <br /> And this is pretty much all I have on the subject. (I also had another really cool image in my &quot;Landscapes &amp; Scenery -&gt; West&quot; folder, but upon taking a closer look, I realized that the dark bluish-grey thing I mentally categorized as 'probably the sea' actually looks more like stone, and the upward-curving dark shape in the foreground next to our hero is, in fact, not an elaborate figurehead of some sort, but the roof of a building. Awkward.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Damn. *right-click* *Save Image*<br /> I'm gonna dare a bit too - got something with a Pharaonic Egypt feel? I re-fluffed Varang as an Egypt expy for a PC, and I'm woefully low on pics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T03:47:41-07:00","id":1152747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1150420#post1150420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a ton of images depicting spooky-looking people who would make fine Abyssals, but this is one of my favorites because the colorful tattoos give her look a bit of much-needed cheer:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/736x/01/7a/f3/017af38a8f49902b4eb3baa064fe8325--luis-royo-dead.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u60aa\u9b54- Devil; <i>Akuma &quot;ah-KOO-ma&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Because subtlety is for plebeians. </span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T04:02:39-07:00","id":1152751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sorcerous Overlord</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1152747#post1152747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=