ignature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T07:41:29-07:00","id":1225262,"title":"","content":"I recently got my full volumes of 1001 Knights, and there are quite a few images that I find very fitting to Exalted in there, but they're unfortunately not available online, and I would not feel comfortable scanning them even if I had the means.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T07:48:57-07:00","id":1225267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225256#post1225256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bThat... is a conversation to be had elsewhere.<br /> <br /> \u200bHowever, I can make a point that I think effectively challenges it in just a single line:<br /> <br /> \u200bWould this be your response to criticisms of The Birth of a Nation? <i>Somebody</i> is consuming it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The best way to identify fools is to let them speak, write, and watch stupid, racist movies. Discourse, not silence, changes people.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T07:54:21-07:00","id":1225270,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225256#post1225256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> \u200bThat... is a conversation to be had elsewhere.<br /> <br /> \u200bHowever, I can make a point that I think effectively challenges it in just a single line:<br /> <br /> \u200bWould this be your response to criticisms of The Birth of a Nation? <i>Somebody</i> is consuming it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would you argue against someone's right to imagine and create it?<br /> <br /> I vote with my wallet. I don't like it, I don't buy it.<br /> <br /> I vote with my time. I don't like it, I won't invest in experiencing it.<br /> <br /> I am consuming the drawings my 2 and 5 year old produce, they are awful. They have a place in my fridge and walls, and on my heart and mind.<br /> <br /> There is someone somewhere to consume anything.<br /> <br /> Also, please don't take this as me saying nobody can or should criticize art. Everyone can and should. Only there is an approrpiate place for it. This thread specifically asks to leave commentary out.<br /> <br /> And last I checked nudity is still ok, and I hope it forever is (I would miss Jen's scantily clad fellows also, if it wasn't, for the record).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:00:41-07:00","id":1225277,"title":"","content":"Heck, Halycon450 does a neat 'Usurpation-Era Solar, as seen from the perspective of his righteous Dragonblooded opponents' very well.<br /> <img src=\"https://img00.deviantart.net/1a7d/i/2018/105/8/a/yegor__undoing_of_the_lightless_by_halycon450-dc8x9l9.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>Notice the mixture of holy imagery and horror to generate something you could, almost, imagine as having once been a worthy Chosen of the Unconquered Sun. You almost feel shame in the fact that someone so glorious has to die, or else the world will end in absolute tyranny and madness.<br /> <br /> One of favorite comics from 2e, by the way, was the one from the Terrestrial Directions, North with the dam breaking on the White Valley.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":306,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","user":"Brasstreader","date":". 06-06-2018, 11:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:09:59-07:00","id":1225282,"title":"","content":"Wow <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar306_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"306\" data-vbnamecard=\"306\">Brasstreader</a> , those are amazing! Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:21:52-07:00","id":1225284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225270#post1225270\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Would you argue against someone's right to imagine and create it?</div> </div> </div> </div>You know what that film is about, right?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:30:47-07:00","id":1225288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225256#post1225256\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bWould this be your response to criticisms of The Birth of a Nation? <i>Somebody</i> is consuming it.</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Yes.</i><br /> <br /> You can complain all you want, my point is that this particular complaint about drawings is getting tiresome. Or, rather, the fact it keeps being brought up incessantly. At this point the impression I get is that people feel all but obligated to point it out, as if they can't just appreciate (or not appreciate) in silence. It's an annoying zeitgeist, preaching to no one.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:34:34-07:00","id":1225290,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Brasstreader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225277#post1225277\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heck, Halycon450 does a neat 'Usurpation-Era Solar, as seen from the perspective of his righteous Dragonblooded opponents' very well.<br /> &lt;image&gt;<br /> Notice the mixture of holy imagery and horror to generate something you could, almost, imagine as having once been a worthy Chosen of the Unconquered Sun. You almost feel shame in the fact that someone so glorious has to die, or else the world will end in absolute tyranny and madness.<br /> <br /> One of favorite comics from 2e, by the way, was the one from the Terrestrial Directions, North with the dam breaking on the White Valley.</div> </div> </div> </div>His head's composition makes me think of Hellblade's enemy designs, for some reason. Might be Surtr.<br /> <img src=\"https://cdn1.twinfinite.net/wp-content/uploads/2017/08/hellblade-senuas.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:40:08-07:00","id":1225294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225288#post1225288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Yes.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI imagine that it was probably a bit hard for somebody who would have objected on a very personal level to being portrayed as a rape-happy animal to simply ignore the existence of the film when other people who saw it became super enthusiastic about harassing and murdering them.<br /> <br /> \u200bThings that contribute to normalizing a popular image of women as sexual objects are perhaps not <i>as</i> extreme, although still often unpleasant for people that want to enjoy fantast media without it.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Which is not to say that a normalized attitude of female sexual availability is something that has not also resulted in harassment and murder)<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can complain all you want, my point is that this particular complaint about drawings is getting tiresome. Or, rather, the fact it keeps being brought up incessantly.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's easy for something to come up a lot when there's an oversaturation of the subject matter.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's an annoying zeitgeist, preaching to no one.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bOh I don't know; I think that vocal statements by developers for Exalted Third Edition have suggested that they were preached to with a <i>bit</i> of success.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T08:53:02-07:00","id":1225301,"title":"","content":"You are not separating fantasy for reality, and condemning watching a story as a likened to perpetrating the act. <br /> <br /> I dispense the thought policing, thank you very much, and let's continue this on the other thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T09:01:40-07:00","id":1225306,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:white\">ten characters</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":3443,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","user":"aluminiumtrioxid","date":".  OT content deleted, images pending 06-06-2018, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T11:40:48-07:00","id":1225380,"title":"","content":"Please remember.<br /> <br /> You do not have to like scantily clad women in art. But other people are allowed to. This is not the thread to discuss people's taste in art.<br /> <br /> If you feel something violates the terms of use, ask for moderation.<br /> <br /> Everybody has the right to have their Exalted with as many dressed or undressed, men women and anything in between and beyond.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sexy&quot; is not bad wrong fun. You're entitled to not like it, to not look at it, and to not be inspired by it. Other people have a right to not care and, in this thread, not hear about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T12:03:27-07:00","id":1225392,"title":"","content":"You guys realise that in response to this fairly small, undramatic post;<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hugely awesome art style. Not a big fan of the &quot;women hate clothes&quot; trope, however. A chance wasted. Then again, if you're that good an artist, you can draw whatever the fuck you want</div> </div> </div> </div>There have now been 8 comments telling Cheshire Cat they are not allowed to express their opinion of &quot;I like this, don't like this, but if you're a good artist you can draw what you like&quot;, and 2 comments arguing with those 8 comments.<br /> <br /> Maybe chill and post some pictures? If you want to argue about it, we seem to have two seperate threads about it, go do that there.<br /> <br /> I'd follow this by posting some art, but this forum hates me posting pictures. I don't know why. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 06-06-2018, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T12:35:25-07:00","id":1225408,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UpPs5R3.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6893-drazhya","name":"Drazhya","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T12:37:09-07:00","id":1225409,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225392#post1225392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You guys realise that in response to this fairly small, undramatic post;<br /> <br /> There have now been 8 comments telling Cheshire Cat they are not allowed to express their opinion of &quot;I like this, don't like this, but if you're a good artist you can draw what you like&quot;, and 2 comments arguing with those 8 comments.<br /> <br /> Maybe chill and post some pictures? If you want to argue about it, we seem to have two seperate threads about it, go do that there.<br /> <br /> I'd follow this by posting some art, but this forum hates me posting pictures. I don't know why. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed.<br /> Come get a taste of what I found:<br /> <img src=\"https://orig00.deviantart.net/cb7f/f/2018/143/b/9/exalted__outcastes_prestige_spread_by_gunshiprevolution-dccdjyf.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T12:44:00-07:00","id":1225413,"title":"","content":"Huh, where is that from?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T13:37:13-07:00","id":1225432,"title":"","content":"On the &quot;darker art&quot; note, I've always found FromSoftware's design art to be a goldmine of ideas for a somewhat more Underworld oriented-art. Bloodborne in particular has the grotesque down pat.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette.wikia.nocookie.net/bloodborne/images/f/f5/Pthumerian_Elder_concept_Art.png/revision/latest?cb=20171227084948\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T13:41:56-07:00","id":1225435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225413#post1225413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh, where is that from?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a picture of outcastes from the Dragon Blooded kickstarter.<br /> <br /> \u200bI can't remember all of the names, but the broad-brimmed hat are those Northern ghost-hunters, the purple armour is one of those people associated with the raksha, and I believe the big fellow on the right is Saloy Hin.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-06T14:08:37-07:00","id":1225455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225435#post1225435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a picture of outcastes from the Dragon Blooded kickstarter.<br /> <br /> \u200bI can't remember all of the names, but the broad-brimmed hat are those Northern ghost-hunters, the purple armour is one of those people associated with the raksha, and I believe the big fellow on the right is Saloy Hin.</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured that had to be from actual Exalted but I couldn't place it either. Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my homebrew exalt: The Fabulists - Chosen of the Raksha <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1141861-peach-new-exalt-splat-the-fabulist-exalts-chosen-of-the-raksha\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8804-armyofwhispers","name":"armyofwhispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8804_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T04:07:11-07:00","id":1225541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TGUEIROS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225251#post1225251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Art.<br /> <br /> Don't like it, don't consume it.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You're 100% right and I think I pre-empted your comment neatly by agreeing with you already in my post. My complaint is petty, but it is factual that I prefer actually using character art in my games that involves a bit more garment. If context requires bare skin I am fine with it, but I just cannot bring myself too perpetuate the bikini warrior trope.<br /> So in closing: I really really loved that art. The art style is basically 95% in sync with my personal taste. I will, however, not steal said art to portray player characters or NPCs in my games, if they don't wear more clothes. I'm trying not to be a dick about it, but I think there's merit to having the occasional discussion about how much half-naked ladies are necessary in fantasy art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T04:17:21-07:00","id":1225543,"title":"","content":"I think it's less that it's necessary for fantasy and more that you can't really get away with it anywhere else. <br /> <br /> So it's not &quot;I wanna draw fantasy, lets put some tiddies in it&quot; but rather &quot;I wanna draw tiddies, lets make it fantasy so it doesn't look weird.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T04:49:26-07:00","id":1225546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225543#post1225543\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's less that it's necessary for fantasy and more that you can't really get away with it anywhere else.<br /> <br /> So it's not &quot;I wanna draw fantasy, lets put some tiddies in it&quot; but rather &quot;I wanna draw tiddies, lets make it fantasy so it doesn't look weird.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You might've just blown my mind a bit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T05:10:31-07:00","id":1225547,"title":"","content":"Did we have this one posted btw? <br /> <img src=\"https://img00.deviantart.net/640d/i/2014/250/b/b/degenesis___sixmorevodka_by_esbenlash-d7y9wac.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> It's from this guy: <a href=\"https://esbenlash.deviantart.com/art/DEGENESIS-SIXMOREVODKA-479993566\" target=\"_blank\">https://esbenlash.deviantart.com/art...ODKA-479993566</a><br /> And it's always worth plundering German RPG &quot;Degenesis&quot; for Exalted art. It's a bit niche on the whole post-apocalypse thingy, but you often have overlap, and they have glorious art direction.<br /> Also worth checking out: Swedish RPG Symbaroum and their art. The barbarian stuff is very Lunar-y.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T07:22:34-07:00","id":1225569,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225541#post1225541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You're 100% right and I think I pre-empted your comment neatly by agreeing with you already in my post. My complaint is petty, but it is factual that I prefer actually using character art in my games that involves a bit more garment. If context requires bare skin I am fine with it, but I just cannot bring myself too perpetuate the bikini warrior trope.<br /> So in closing: I really really loved that art. The art style is basically 95% in sync with my personal taste. I will, however, not steal said art to portray player characters or NPCs in my games, if they don't wear more clothes. I'm trying not to be a dick about it, but I think there's merit to having the occasional discussion about how much half-naked ladies are necessary in fantasy art.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're also 100% right!<br /> <br /> Your comment was very mild. We can have as many of those discussions as anyone wants!<br /> <br /> We're having it on the off-topic forum, right now. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T07:38:58-07:00","id":1225575,"title":"","content":"So, is there anything you fine people would like to see in particular? I have a bunch of pictures on my PC, and thanks to the kindness of one of my players who is currently running a game for the group, no immediate opportunity to use them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T08:19:08-07:00","id":1225584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225575#post1225575\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, is there anything you fine people would like to see in particular? I have a bunch of pictures on my PC, and thanks to the kindness of one of my players who is currently running a game for the group, no immediate opportunity to use them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm a fan of duality.<br /> Show me you character on his/her Best day, and on his/her Worst Day. Does defeat fill them with Rage, or Sorrow? Does triumph bring contentment, or renewed vainglory and hunger?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T09:09:15-07:00","id":1225604,"title":"","content":"If you've got anything Egyptian-esque or Medieval-East-Coast-of-Africa-esque, that'd be great for me. Or ancient ruins in jungles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-07T09:34:28-07:00","id":1225606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1225604#post1225604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you've got anything Egyptian-esque or Medieval-East-Coast-of-Africa-esque, that'd be great for me. Or ancient ruins in jungles.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh man, ancient ruins in jungles are my favorite. Have at them:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://www.wallpaperup.com/uploads/wallpapers/2013/02/04/34271/0c08c419da541a4c0c0a9ae69e13a76e.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/VcgAtYm.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://img00.deviantart.net/d954/i/2016/311/c/0/ancient_architect_by_2buiart-dankytz.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://wallpaper-gallery.net/images/tomb-wallpaper/tomb-wallpaper-19.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> (You probably want to find some way to scrub Ms. Croft off of this last one in order for it to be usable.)<br /> <br /> <br /> As for Egyptian-esque stuff, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/411718-inspirational-art-exalted-3e-edition?p=1153467#post1153467\">this earlier post of mine</a> includes some links to places where you can browse to your heart's content.<br /> <br /> <br /> Edit: apparently the last image is sometimes a no-show - you can still get it by quoting my post, going to source (leftmost icon on the toolbar), and following the link in the IMG tags.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the de